     Unguryanu TN, Stepovaia DA, Belyaevskaya IA, Gaiduk SV, Bobykin KS, Volkov NG, Kuznetsova DL, Kosareva EN, Glukhanova AS. Assessment of the chemical
     and radiological safety of wild mushrooms and berries growing in the Arkhangelsk region. Ekologiya cheloveka (Human Ecology). 2023;30(1):17–27.
