also for remediation purposes, with the possibility of reducing the concentrations
of hazardous chemical elements in the food consumed by the larvae or increasing
the nutritional value of the resulting substrate in trophically treated waste.                      Figure 1 Black soldier fly (URL1) and larvae (orig. Barboráková)
